      <div class="about-copy">
        <p>My name is Benli Liu, an aviation photographer and aircraft spotting enthusiast based in Atlanta. I photograph commercial aircraft, unusual visitors, special liveries, and everyday airport operations.</p>
        <p>I am currently a graduate student at Georgia Tech majoring Electrical and Computer Engineering. My interest in aircraft spotting also led me to create Aircraft Spotter Radar, a project designed to help spotters discover interesting aircraft movements.</p>
